                    <ul>
                        
                        <li id="rowSpecialRequirementLanguage">
                            <span id="lblSpecialRequirement_Language">The position(s) require(s) fluency in the Spanish language.  If the State of California does not have a current record documenting your fluency in this language, you will be required to successfully pass an approved language fluency test prior to being hired.</span></li>
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        
                        

                        
                        
